{"candidateAnswer":"August 2023","evidence":"[D4:8 | 4:17 pm on 2 August, 2023] John: Oh yeah, I remember you telling me about Harry Potter! I've got a funny story. Anthony and I went to this charity thing and ended up in this intense Harry Potter trivia contest. We did alright, but there was this one super-nerd there that took home this as a prize.\n\n[D22:2 | 7:42 pm on 8 December, 2023] John: Hey Tim! Sounds awesome! So glad you had a blast at the Harry Potter party. Last August I told you about my fun time at a charity event with Harry Potter trivia. Love being with people who are as passionate about Harry Potter as us! Did you dress up as any character?","itemId":"urn:uuid:082e4eb0-735e-56a6-ad9a-51bfa44fddfc","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:cb9c0813fc456ca69b521fcc6fecde54a0cd6078a01c8783206e51f276ca6513","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did John attend the Harry Potter trivia?","referenceAnswer":"August 2023.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"cb9c0813fc456ca69b521fcc6fecde54a0cd6078a01c8783206e51f276ca6513"}}]}